# DigitalShield Frontend Configuration Template
# All variables prefixed with VITE_ are embedded into the client-side JavaScript bundle at build time.
# NEVER place private keys, API secrets, database credentials, or passwords in this file.

# Base URL for API requests.
# Omit or leave as "/api" for recommended same-origin / reverse-proxy deployments.
# For separate-origin deployments only (requires backend CORS):
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.staging.digitalshield.app/api
